\item[\ \ presuppositions:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item dictionary:\\
Animate CNs are supposed to have sexes (masculine or feminine, not both) (see 
the remark made under TObjReflInsertion1); inanimate 
CNs should have sexes = [], but may have gender specification (default = 
omegagender; words like {\em ship\/} may also have femininegender). It is assumed 
that all CNs are 3rd person.
